{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0293_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0293_1000_p", "source_sha256": "3ebe0b69beac069c174c5f07c1bd5306b4a4f87507a13619e1449346b878f2d3", "ja": "（今日はグラビア雑誌『アイグラ！！』の撮影だ。\n美奈子は、スタッフさんと話し込んでいる……）", "zh": "（今天要拍摄写真杂志《偶像写真！！》。\n美奈子正和工作人员聊得热火朝天……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0293_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0293_1001_019min", "source_sha256": "fc5914e1fb52e6c1946a72e4221996dc323790f44603e3b62ae8013b4e65ebac", "ja": "あ、{$P$}さん！\nこのパジャマに合う夜食って、なんだと思いますか？", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生！\n你觉得什么夜宵适合搭配这套睡衣呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0293_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0293_1002_019min", "source_sha256": "8430195a73aad7e39046eabb8478d33ea3f639e0fab74cc8150f8255a4867462", "ja": "撮影で、夜食を作るシーンがあるんです。\nせっかくだし、衣装に合う料理にしようかなって。", "zh": "拍摄中有一幕是要做夜宵。\n难得有这个机会，我想做些和服装相配的料理。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0293_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0293_1003_p", "source_sha256": "ea3465679f684622543c06bdd7a233acd92246d6d666de36fe82a2b9dfeebdce", "ja": "なるほど、夜食か。\nそれでさっき、スタッフさんと話してたんだな。", "zh": "原来是夜宵啊。难怪刚才在和工作人员商量。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0293_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0293_1004_019min", "source_sha256": "1bd341328cf815e6f5b8fc15729c1c227522f388ed0a3d6b63acf701d94abd2a", "ja": "はい。いろいろと候補を考えたんですけど、\nどれもしっくりこなくて……。", "zh": "是的。我考虑了好几个方案，可总觉得哪个都不太合适……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0293_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0293_1005_p", "source_sha256": "18d2b63301bad65ce55ce21bd0caa1162db0ce1d1fcad7d4e231c6b8812ee8f6", "ja": "そうだったのか。うーん……\nそのパジャマなら、サンドイッチなんてどうだ？", "zh": "原来是这样啊。嗯……既然是那套睡衣，三明治怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0293_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0293_1006_019min", "source_sha256": "a2722f5cfb4afd6c196c7f2257e2e4bfe8446946a367e37ca237292354aa2996", "ja": "わぁ～。いいですね、サンドイッチ！\nオシャレな感じで、衣装にもピッタリです！", "zh": "哇～。不错呢，三明治！\n感觉很时尚，也和服装特别搭！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0293_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0293_1007_019min", "source_sha256": "d808bf84eb3bbca117d13c0867db67d60802ddfe440135a5cbba463d8cdc6902", "ja": "サンドイッチを作るとして……問題は中身ですよね。\nボリュームは妥協できないしな～。", "zh": "要做三明治的话……问题就在馅料了吧。\n分量可不能妥协啊～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0293_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0293_1008_p", "source_sha256": "81b1eeb5993afab7d5c0103cd7b32fc1728a2d19576b886baeb626db019baffd", "ja": "そうだな。ランチなら多めがいいけど、\n今回は夜食だし、控えめでいいんじゃないかな？", "zh": "是啊。要是当午餐吃，分量多一点比较好，不过这次是夜宵，少做一点不就行了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0293_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0293_1009_019min", "source_sha256": "fdaf3b6dd69877bd30ef41b4fc7338bae1ea7882ab1446277a706009daf3b2bc", "ja": "えっ！　でもでも夜食って、お仕事や勉強が忙しい時に\n食べることが多いですよね？", "zh": "咦！可是夜宵一般都是在工作或学习很忙的时候吃的，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0293_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0293_1010_019min", "source_sha256": "22b126cb29a1db5159e7a8b8c1cb3bb23b0a12b7ce7a32af6cfd08c7eb92c44c", "ja": "お腹がいっぱいになったら、その後も頑張ろう！\nって、元気の源になりませんか？", "zh": "吃饱了之后，就能继续努力！\n这不是会成为活力的源泉吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0293_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0293_1011_p", "source_sha256": "98bdbf724b8a00297b096b8345827dfafe12965f6e1d4ca3ca8ba9c7e41bf282", "ja": "まあ、確かに……それはあるかも？", "zh": "嗯，确实……倒也可能会这样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0293_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0293_1012_019min", "source_sha256": "a269e64eef0f52a12f05a9c7d7115e5b7c0f7224667abbbf06d267688dbbc70b", "ja": "でもそっか……。{$P$}さんは、\n控えめの方がいいんですね。それじゃ……。", "zh": "不过，这么说来……确实也有这种可能……{$P$}先生还是低调一点比较好，对吧。那么……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0293_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0293_1013_019min", "source_sha256": "eb9d782bc8c62f6963722c5fc28955c8dd2ff8e2cc2ca625de04e0af5ba7e651", "ja": "あ、フルーツサンドなんてどうですか？　たっぷりの\n生クリームとたくさんのフルーツで控えめですよ♪", "zh": "啊，水果三明治怎么样？满满的鲜奶油和大量水果，很低调哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0293_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0293_1014_p", "source_sha256": "f3a7f2cbead4817c4c618c071400cb8bacdd413031bdd3e7ff7fa78313ff5b6c", "ja": "フルーツサンドか。量は気になるとこだけど……\nその衣装には合ってると思うよ。", "zh": "水果三明治啊。分量确实让人在意，不过……\n我觉得和那套服装很相配。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0293_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0293_1015_019min", "source_sha256": "65317f42b8bc1964c8e089b195e54034cb0e8fd771a964569873886c90254884", "ja": "ふふっ、よかった♪　今日の夜食は決まりましたね、\n{$P$}さん！", "zh": "呵呵，太好了♪ 今天的夜宵就这么定了，{$P$}先生！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0293_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0293_1016_p", "source_sha256": "58b0e970a7154805b730c7b8b8c1de11e8ba344e7e958f428d8b770162b6c66a", "ja": "えっ？", "zh": "咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0293_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0293_1017_019min", "source_sha256": "e71a3c972550a59a2b6746a54c7c955f7044df77584dfb4472366caa92e7b1ad", "ja": "このパジャマに負けないくらい、\nとびっきりかわいいフルーツサンド作りますね♪", "zh": "我会做出可爱得完全不输给这件睡衣的水果三明治哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0293_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0293_1018_p", "source_sha256": "7aa11a711915ea5f44c5dde2da7b5a6987ed890d3fae768ca5474a6e567da2d3", "ja": "（とても美奈子らしい写真と大量のサンドイッチが\n出来上がった。……完食するために、今夜は徹夜だな）", "zh": "（照片拍得非常有美奈子的风格，还做出了大量三明治。……为了把它们全部吃完，今晚得通宵了）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
